      en: ["The highest point is 3,491 meters above sea level", "It is located on the border of Mongolia and Russia", "It is the tallest peak in the Sayan mountain range", "Lake Khövsgöl is situated directly south of the massif", "First ascent was in 1858 by explorer Gustav Radde", "The mountain peak remains snow-covered all year round"],
